<details>
  <summary>What is The Well?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>The Well is a Christ-centered retreat created to offer space for rest, reflection, worship, fun, and renewal – a weekend to step away from everyday life and spend intentional time with God and a community of women.</p></div>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Who is The Well for?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>The Well welcomes women of all ages who are longing for rest, renewal, and deeper connection with God. Because the retreat is held outdoors on natural terrain, participants should feel comfortable walking on uneven ground.</p></div>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>When is The Well?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>{{ site.event.datesLong }}.</p></div>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Where is The Well?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>The Well will be held in North Fort Myers, Florida. Exact location details will be shared with registered attendees.</p></div>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Is this a Christian retreat?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>Yes, The Well is a Christ-centered retreat rooted in Scripture. You do not need to be strong in your faith or have everything figured out to attend. Women come from many different places in their journey and are welcome just as they are.</p></div>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Can I come alone?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>Many women attend on their own. The retreat is intentionally designed to feel welcoming and comfortable, while gently inviting moments of growth outside of your comfort zone.</p></div>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Will I be required to share or participate?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>No. You are never required to share or participate beyond what feels comfortable for you.</p></div>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>What will the weekend look like?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>The weekend includes worship, teaching, creative activities, time in nature, sisterhood, and space for rest and reflection.</p></div>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Is The Well physically demanding?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>Activities are gentle but include walking and light hiking on uneven ground. Participants should feel comfortable being outdoors and moving at a relaxed pace. All activities are optional.</p></div>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>How do I register?</summary>
  <div class="acc-body"><p>Registration is available directly through the website. <a href="{{ '/registration/' | url }}">Sign up here</a>.</p></div>
</details>
